            <section>
              <section>
                <header>Pages, block by block</header>
                <paragraph>Landing pages in Exponential are built from zones and blocks. Pick a zone layout, drop in a hero, a content grid or a gallery, choose which content each block shows, and schedule items to appear and disappear on their own.</paragraph>
              </section>
              <section>
                <header>Blocks for every story</header>
                <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">
                  <ul>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Main story and campaign blocks for the big message.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Content grids in one to four columns.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Galleries, item lists, video, polls, tag clouds and feedback forms.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph>The page you are reading right now and the home page are both built this way.</paragraph>
              </section>
            </section>
